{"id":"9fefe9c472fa2311","group":"14","path":"14/14-df-geometric-morphism-category.md","title":"Definition — 几何态射范畴与二胞","display":"Definition — 几何态射范畴与二胞","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Sheaves in Geometry and Logic (Mac Lane & Moerdijk)","book_abbrev":"14","label":"14-df-geometric-morphism-category","aliases":["14-df-geometric-morphism-category"],"display":"Definition — 几何态射范畴与二胞","depends_on":["[[14-df-geometric-morphism]]","[[14-df-natural-transformation]]","[[14-df-natural-transformation-composition-whiskering]]","[[14-df-functor-full-subcategory]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Sheaves in Geometry and Logic (Mac Lane &amp; Moerdijk)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"14"},{"key":"label","html":"14-df-geometric-morphism-category"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>14-df-geometric-morphism-category</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"Definition — 几何态射范畴与二胞"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"9752b779c5f463f9\" href=\"?note=9752b779c5f463f9\" title=\"14-df-geometric-morphism\">14-df-geometric-morphism</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"1bdaf4a293143165\" href=\"?note=1bdaf4a293143165\" title=\"14-df-natural-transformation\">14-df-natural-transformation</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"f012515fd4cf0061\" href=\"?note=f012515fd4cf0061\" title=\"14-df-natural-transformation-composition-whiskering\">14-df-natural-transformation-composition-whiskering</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"1601eff2507fda14\" href=\"?note=1601eff2507fda14\" title=\"14-df-functor-full-subcategory\">14-df-functor-full-subcategory</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal F,\\mathcal E\">\\(\\mathcal F,\\mathcal E\\)</span> 为初等拓扑斯；几何态射采用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"9752b779c5f463f9\" href=\"?note=9752b779c5f463f9\" title=\"14-df-geometric-morphism\">14-df-geometric-morphism</a>，自然变换采用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"1bdaf4a293143165\" href=\"?note=1bdaf4a293143165\" title=\"14-df-natural-transformation\">14-df-natural-transformation</a>。</li>\n<li>所有函子和自然变换在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal V\">\\(\\mathcal V\\)</span> 中编码；函子集合见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"1601eff2507fda14\" href=\"?note=1601eff2507fda14\" title=\"14-df-functor-full-subcategory\">14-df-functor-full-subcategory</a>，自然变换的恒等与竖直复合见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"f012515fd4cf0061\" href=\"?note=f012515fd4cf0061\" title=\"14-df-natural-transformation-composition-whiskering\">14-df-natural-transformation-composition-whiskering</a>。Geom 的箭头另用 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(f,g,\\alpha)\">\\((f,g,\\alpha)\\)</span> 包装，以记录完整几何态射的源与靶；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f=(f^*,f_*)\">\\(f=(f^*,f_*)\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"g=(g^*,g_*)\">\\(g=(g^*,g_*)\\)</span>。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf G_0\\coloneqq\\{f\\in\\mathrm{Funs}(\\mathcal E,\\mathcal F)\\times\\mathrm{Funs}(\\mathcal F,\\mathcal E)\\mid\\mathrm{IsGeometricMorphism}(f,\\mathcal F,\\mathcal E)\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf G_0\\coloneqq\\{f\\in\\mathrm{Funs}(\\mathcal E,\\mathcal F)\\times\\mathrm{Funs}(\\mathcal F,\\mathcal E)\\mid\\mathrm{IsGeometricMorphism}(f,\\mathcal F,\\mathcal E)\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Geom2}(f,g)\\coloneqq\\mathrm{Hom}_{\\mathrm{FunCat}(\\mathcal E,\\mathcal F)}(f^*,g^*)\\qquad(f,g\\in\\mathsf G_0).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{Geom2}(f,g)\\coloneqq\\mathrm{Hom}_{\\mathrm{FunCat}(\\mathcal E,\\mathcal F)}(f^*,g^*)\\qquad(f,g\\in\\mathsf G_0).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf G_1\\coloneqq\\{(f,g,\\alpha)\\mid f,g\\in\\mathsf G_0\\land\\alpha\\in\\mathrm{Geom2}(f,g)\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf G_1\\coloneqq\\{(f,g,\\alpha)\\mid f,g\\in\\mathsf G_0\\land\\alpha\\in\\mathrm{Geom2}(f,g)\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Geom}(\\mathcal F,\\mathcal E)\\coloneqq\\bigl(\\mathsf G_0,\\mathsf G_1,((f,g,\\alpha)\\mapsto f),((f,g,\\alpha)\\mapsto g),(f\\mapsto(f,f,1_{f^*})),(((g,h,\\beta),(f,g,\\alpha))\\mapsto(f,h,\\beta\\circ\\alpha))\\bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{Geom}(\\mathcal F,\\mathcal E)\\coloneqq\\bigl(\\mathsf G_0,\\mathsf G_1,((f,g,\\alpha)\\mapsto f),((f,g,\\alpha)\\mapsto g),(f\\mapsto(f,f,1_{f^*})),(((g,h,\\beta),(f,g,\\alpha))\\mapsto(f,h,\\beta\\circ\\alpha))\\bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{IsCategory}(\\mathrm{Geom}(\\mathcal F,\\mathcal E)),\\qquad\\mathrm{Hom}_{\\mathrm{Geom}(\\mathcal F,\\mathcal E)}(f,g)=\\{(f,g,\\alpha)\\mid\\alpha\\in\\mathrm{Geom2}(f,g)\\}\\qquad(f,g\\in\\mathsf G_0).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{IsCategory}(\\mathrm{Geom}(\\mathcal F,\\mathcal E)),\\qquad\\mathrm{Hom}_{\\mathrm{Geom}(\\mathcal F,\\mathcal E)}(f,g)=\\{(f,g,\\alpha)\\mid\\alpha\\in\\mathrm{Geom2}(f,g)\\}\\qquad(f,g\\in\\mathsf G_0).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>原书 VIII.1–3 的几何态射 Hom 范畴。六元组现在明确包含对象、箭头、源、靶、恒等与复合；自然变换的结合律和单位律逐分量给出该六元组的范畴公理。对象与箭头均由 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal V\">\\(\\mathcal V\\)</span> 中的函数集合界定，未把只列 Ob/Hom 的记号当成已存在的范畴数据。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"14-df-geometric-morphism","status":"resolved","id":"9752b779c5f463f9","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[14-df-geometric-morphism]]","embed":false},{"target":"14-df-natural-transformation","status":"resolved","id":"1bdaf4a293143165","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[14-df-natural-transformation]]","embed":false},{"target":"14-df-natural-transformation-composition-whiskering","status":"resolved","id":"f012515fd4cf0061","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[14-df-natural-transformation-composition-whiskering]]","embed":false},{"target":"14-df-functor-full-subcategory","status":"resolved","id":"1601eff2507fda14","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[14-df-functor-full-subcategory]]","embed":false},{"target":"14-df-geometric-morphism","status":"resolved","id":"9752b779c5f463f9","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathcal F,\\mathcal E$ 为初等拓扑斯；几何态射采用 [[14-df-geometric-morphism]]，自然变换采用 [[14-df-natural-transformation]]。","embed":false},{"target":"14-df-natural-transformation","status":"resolved","id":"1bdaf4a293143165","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathcal F,\\mathcal E$ 为初等拓扑斯；几何态射采用 [[14-df-geometric-morphism]]，自然变换采用 [[14-df-natural-transformation]]。","embed":false}