d(f,g\\in\\mathsf G_0).","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathcal V","display":false}],"bytes":2136,"backlinks":[{"id":"c53146be63465990","anchor":"ref-228","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[14-df-geometric-morphism-category|Definition — 几何态射范畴与二胞]]"},{"id":"a76b2bc2c7b718cf","anchor":"ref-12","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$S$ 是固定的 $\\mathcal U$-小多类签名，$S_0$ 为其类集合；$\\mathbb T$ 是 [[14-df-geometric-theory-models]] 的有穷几何理论。$\\mathcal B$ 为候选范畴；$\\mathrm{IsGrothendieckTopos}$ 见 [[14-df-giraud-grothendieck-topos]]。模型范畴见 [[14-df-model-homomorphisms-and-category]]，几何态射范畴见 [[14-df-geometric-morphism-category]]，函子等价见 [[14-df-category-equivalence]]。"},{"id":"4741fef73eb1a614","anchor":"ref-63","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[14-df-geometric-morphism-category]]"},{"id":"98293f53034b1166","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"c60ad289d123497b","anchor":"ref-229","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[14-df-geometric-morphism-category|Definition — 几何态射范畴与二胞]]"},{"id":"34f27739c5ea48f5","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"38f60858c822a22c","anchor":"ref-7","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$f:\\mathcal F\\to\\mathcal E$ 为几何态射；$f\\cong h$ 指 [[14-df-geometric-morphism-category]] 的同一几何态射范畴中的对象同构，采用 [[14-df-isomorphism]] 的可逆箭头条件；满射、嵌入、复合分别见 [[14-df-surjective-geometric-morphism]]、[[14-df-geometric-embedding]]、[[14-thm-composition-geometric-morphisms]]。"}],"outgoing":["9752b779c5f463f9","1bdaf4a293143165","f012515fd4cf0061","1601eff2507fda14"]}